# The figure specs pin the dataset by SHA-256 (spec.expectSha256) and the scripts
# refuse to draw when it does not match. Line-ending normalisation on checkout
# would change the file's bytes and therefore its hash, so pin LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.csv  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf

# Figure outputs, if a user regenerates and commits them.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
